OL,3,GNEWSA'Poo bags and shovels are part of 
OL,4,Aour Saturday football kit'             
OL,6,FSaturday mornings mean pitch patrol at 
OL,7,FStow FC in the Scottish Borders.       
OL,9,FBefore the town's kids can step foot on
OL,10,Fthe pitch, volunteer Tucker MacCall    
OL,11,Fdoes his rounds with a big black       
OL,12,Fbucket.                                
OL,14,FThe "poo bin", with bags, shovel and   
OL,15,Fsand, is now part of the club's        
OL,16,FSaturday kit.                          
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
