OL,3,GNEWSA'Poo bags and shovels are part of 
OL,4,Aour Saturday football kit'             
OL,6,F"It's getting beyond a joke," he said. 
OL,7,F"We would normally set up, put the nets
OL,8,Fup, put the flags out to get the       
OL,9,Fbarriers etc ready for the game. Then  
OL,10,Fwe have to do a scour of the pitch, to 
OL,11,Fcheck for dog dirt."                   
